description:
On New Year’s Eve, my Mother in her bedroom was watching fireworks in the distance, from her window and suddenly I heard my Mom saying , hurry there are Orbs/Drones in the sky. I ran quickly trying to get a mobile video using my phone, from her window but I couldn’t get a clear picture. There were 5 of the Orbs at the start. My Wife and soon later my Son was also present to witness this cool event from the bedroom window . I then hurried and went downstairs to the backyard to get a better video and there was only one single orb left in the sky. Then proceeded to watch the fantastic northern lights in the sky above our house.
