I was observing planes in my garden and using flight radar to follow a USAF plane. I saw said plane and then noticed another light, at first I thought it was a plane but looked closer and it was a disc shape moving very fast side to side, backwards and forwards. It had a ring of lights in the middle as in what a stereotypical flying saucer looks like. It was red, then green then pink and changed colours not in that order but the lights changed. It seemed to rotate 90 degrees like a saucer turning sideways. I observed it for around a minute before it disappeared. I heard no sounds it was silent. I checked the airspace and no other aircraft where above, other than the USAF plane that I just saw. At the same time I could see the UFO.
