One object was seen, with four pink lights forming a rectangle at its base. Aircraft moved in various directions, in a way different from jet engine aircraft or rotor aircraft like helicopters. In the fourth recording, it can be seen suddenly changing direction and accelerating faster than most commercial or passenger aircraft can accelerate. The object seemed to be several miles away from the camera. When zooming in, the camera was magnified 15 times (x15) on the phone. The phone used was iPhone 14 Pro. There was no distinct sound coming from the aircraft. It was seen on the west from the sighting location reported, and after about 4 minutes, as can be seen on the fourth (last) recording, it started distancing itself further towards the west/northwest.
