Object was oddly shaped and too large to be a drone. It did a 2-4km radius circle around us, and then flew directly overhead. Witnesses present described the object as moving directly towards us, and zigzagging around. The encounter lasted roughly 20 minutes. The shape was somewhat long/cigar shaped, however the dark conditions made it difficult to make out the exact shape. It resembled the "drones" which were seen around military sites last year (white light in the middle flanked by a red and green lights). It was around the size of a small vehicle. Both of our cameras picked up an odd green lens flare while recording. The objects body appeared black in color. There was 1 object observed. The object moved at a consistent rate, and appeared to glide through the air effortlessly.
Observers were between the ages of 21 and 24 (2 males and 2 females), sober, alert and formerly educated.
