I was on a Southwest Airlines flight coming from Albuquerque, New Mexico to Houston Texas. On our final approach into hobby airport, about 20 minutes before we touched down, I noticed approximately eight orb like objects off in the distance in front of a large bank of clouds with lightning.A few seconds after that I saw only what I can describe as a large beetle like object with two legs hanging below it approaching our aircraft. There was a small green light on the face of it and an even smaller dot of a light up and to the right of the green light. I was sitting in a window seat while this beetle object, about the size of a small commercial van, flew near the wing and over the craft. It was so close that I thought the legs on the object would hit the plane. Within a few seconds I, and my daughter, who was sitting next to me, heard a brief, strange, static voice over the airplane intercom. My daughter heard the static voice as well. When we landed, I approached the cockpit to speak to the pilots, but they had already exited the aircraft and actually had gone down outside to the tarmac.
