Orange Orb circling area twice
I saw an orange orb through my window. Went to our door and looked outside, it was a large orange orb. I did get a short video but everyone at our christmas dinner said I was crazy. The orb went out/went into the clouds, not sure which. A few minutes later, it was back in the same area - travelling west again - same path. This time I called my daughter and son-in-law who watched it with me. At one point, it stopped and hovered and then spun in a very small circles while we watched it. It looked like it was moving slightly sideways and then back again. This continued for about 1 minute, then it continued on its way, eventually either going out or into the clouds again.
We checked FlightRadar— there were no small planes in the area.   The orange light was rather large but on camera (iphone) shows as a small white light.   Cloud deck was low - visibility 22 miles according to weather app.
